{"number":100,"name":"سُورَةُ العَادِيَاتِ","englishName":"Al-Aadiyaat","englishNameTranslation":"The Chargers","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":11,"ayahs":[{"number":6147,"numberInSurah":1,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ وَٱلْعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبْحًۭا","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6147.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6147.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"أقسم الله تعالى بالخيل الجاريات في سبيله نحو العدوِّ، حين يظهر صوتها من سرعة عَدْوِها. ولا يجوز للمخلوق أن يقسم إلا بالله، فإن القسم بغير الله شرك.","translationEn":"By the racers, panting,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6148,"numberInSurah":2,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"فَٱلْمُورِيَٰتِ قَدْحًۭا","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6148.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6148.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"فالخيل اللاتي تنقدح النار من صلابة حوافرها؛ من شدَّة عَدْوها.","translationEn":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6149,"numberInSurah":3,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"فَٱلْمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبْحًۭا","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6149.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6149.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"فالمغيرات على الأعداء عند الصبح.","translationEn":"And the chargers at dawn,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6150,"numberInSurah":4,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"فَأَثَرْنَ بِهِۦ نَقْعًۭا","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6150.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6150.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"فهيَّجْنَ بهذا العَدْو غبارًا.","translationEn":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6151,"numberInSurah":5,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"فَوَسَطْنَ بِهِۦ جَمْعًا","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6151.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6151.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"فتوسَّطن بركبانهن جموع الأعداء.","translationEn":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6152,"numberInSurah":6,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٌۭ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6152.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6152.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"إن الإنسان لِنعم ربه لَجحود، وإنه بجحوده ذلك لمقر. وإنه لحب المال لشديد.","translationEn":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6153,"numberInSurah":7,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٌۭ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6153.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6153.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"إن الإنسان لِنعم ربه لَجحود، وإنه بجحوده ذلك لمقر. وإنه لحب المال لشديد.","translationEn":"And indeed, he is to that a witness.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6154,"numberInSurah":8,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلْخَيْرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6154.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6154.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"إن الإنسان لِنعم ربه لَجحود، وإنه بجحوده ذلك لمقر. وإنه لحب المال لشديد.","translationEn":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6155,"numberInSurah":9,"juz":30,"page":599,"textUthmani":"۞ أَفَلَا يَعْلَمُ إِذَا بُعْثِرَ مَا فِى ٱلْقُبُورِ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6155.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6155.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"أفلا يعلم الإنسان ما ينتظره إذا أخرج الله الأموات من القبور للحساب والجزاء؟","translationEn":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6156,"numberInSurah":10,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِى ٱلصُّدُورِ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6156.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6156.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"واستُخرج ما استتر في الصدور من خير أو شر.","translationEn":"And that within the breasts is obtained,","transliterationEn":""},{"number":6157,"numberInSurah":11,"juz":30,"page":600,"textUthmani":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمْ يَوْمَئِذٍۢ لَّخَبِيرٌۢ","audioUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/128/ar.husary/6157.mp3","audioFallbackUrl":"https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.husary/6157.mp3","tafsirMuyassar":"إن ربهم بهم وبأعمالهم يومئذ لخبير، لا يخفى عليه شيء من ذلك.","translationEn":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted.","transliterationEn":""}]}